 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Memory stocks don't trade the news.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.24,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "They trade the calendar.",
   "start": 2.52,
   "end": 3.48,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Around the fifteenth of every month, Korean customs prints the price of memory chips crossing its border.",
   "start": 3.98,
   "end": 8.68,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "If you own the stocks, that print is your metronome.",
   "start": 9.04,
   "end": 11.32,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Hynix and Micron move around it, not after it.",
   "start": 11.82,
   "end": 14.3,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "But here's the part the headline hides:",
   "start": 14.9,
   "end": 16.54,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "when does the month's gain actually land?",
   "start": 17.0,
   "end": 18.82,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty-five months of prints, August twenty-four to August twenty-six.",
   "start": 19.32,
   "end": 22.0,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "In the half-month into the print, the stocks average plus six point eight percent.",
   "start": 22.5,
   "end": 25.62,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "In the half-month after:",
   "start": 26.16,
   "end": 27.58,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "plus two point two.",
   "start": 27.9,
   "end": 29.12,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "The move is front-run.",
   "start": 29.12,
   "end": 30.3,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "A strong print?",
   "start": 30.8,
   "end": 31.54,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Already paid for.",
   "start": 32.14,
   "end": 33.0,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "After the fourteen strong prints, the next two weeks averaged plus three point four.",
   "start": 33.62,
   "end": 37.7,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight of fourteen up.",
   "start": 38.2,
   "end": 39.12,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "A coin flip with drift.",
   "start": 39.7,
   "end": 40.76,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "But now the weak prints.",
   "start": 41.26,
   "end": 42.14,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Eight of them in twenty-five months.",
   "start": 42.68,
   "end": 43.88,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "After seven of the eight, the stocks fell.",
   "start": 44.32,
   "end": 46.0,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Average:",
   "start": 46.32,
   "end": 46.58,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "minus six point nine.",
   "start": 46.58,
   "end": 48.02,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "The latest landed in July.",
   "start": 48.52,
   "end": 49.7,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "One soft print, and the stocks dropped fourteen percent in two weeks.",
   "start": 49.7,
   "end": 53.48,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "The chip price itself?",
   "start": 54.0,
   "end": 54.96,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Sixteen percent higher a month later.",
   "start": 55.56,
   "end": 57.22,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "In finance, we call this asymmetry.",
   "start": 57.72,
   "end": 59.62,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Good news is priced before it lands.",
   "start": 60.22,
   "end": 61.84,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Bad news is the only surprise left.",
   "start": 62.36,
   "end": 64.14,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "So you don't have to read the print faster than the market.",
   "start": 64.64,
   "end": 66.88,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "You have to know the calendar:",
   "start": 67.38,
   "end": 68.44,
   "part": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "the day the print lands is the day the stocks trade it.",
   "start": 68.96,
   "end": 71.22,
   "part": 1
  }
 ],
 "edit_pauses_applied": false
}